Package: cinspecies
Title: Climate Intelligence for Niche Simulation of Species
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mateus", "dos Santos Neves", , "mateus.santos@ufpr.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Automated pipeline for global and regional ecological niche modeling across terrestrial and marine ecosystems. Integrates GBIF occurrence data, automated spatial cleaning and thinning, collinearity filtering (VIF), multi-algorithm ensemble machine learning, and future climate projections across multiple CMIP6 General Circulation Models (GCMs).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
